[ti:Paisa Sanak]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Kabira na ro, sab samne hai, nahi ab inme baaki namak. Har samaya sirf paisa dekhen, chadhi hai inhe sanak.
[00:13.89]Kabira na ro, sab samne hai
[00:19.78]Nahi ab inme baaki namak
[00:25.68]Har samaya sirf paisa dekhen
[00:31.57]Chadhi hai inhe sanak
[00:37.46]Eh eh sanak
[00:43.35]Ole ole sanak
[00:49.24]Mati ka ghat, bech dara thode daam par
[00:55.14]Jo tinke bin ud jai, ohi ko kahen udand
[01:01.03]Saach bolat jo jare man, tinka dara jaam par
[01:06.92]Kabira na ro, sab samne hai
[01:12.81]Nahi ab inme baaki namak
[01:18.70]Sang baithe sab baniye bane, meet sabai bikaau bhaye
[01:24.60]Hari ka naam jo bikai nahi, taako bolat nahi jiye
[01:30.49]Aankhin dekhat loot ho rahi, bhesaj bana re kaal
[01:36.38]Je paisa bin kachhu na karai, tinka karau na haal
[01:42.27]Kabira, ab kahe rowe? Jo khoi go so kaagad tha
[01:48.16]Jo miligo so dhaaga
[01:54.06]Inhi ke sang marihai sab, tu kyun bana re aaga
[01:59.95]Kahe Kabir... paisa aaj ujaar karai... kal maati mein hoti.
